<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Antah 6-mth net up 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Antah 6-mth net up 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  13.60   vs	  11.16</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	  5.81   vs	   4.92</p>
<p>    Turnover		   451.84   vs	 384.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    20.71   vs	  19.10</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.05   vs  less   1.77</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    1.36   vs	   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Antah Holdings Bhd is involved in management, distribution of consumer products, property development and other activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
